[h1]Bloops Showcase[/h1]

[h2]Text formatting[/h2]
[b]bold[/b], [i]italic[/i], [u]underline[/u], [s]strikethrough[/s],
H[sub]2[/sub]O, E = mc[sup]2[/sup], and [color hex=#f38ba8]colored[/color]
[b][color hex=#a6e3a1]bold green[/color][/b] text.
Links open in a [url link="https://pypi.org/project/bloops/"]new tab[/url]
or the [url link="https://github.com/Bubu-Droid/bloops" target=self]same tab[/url].
Sidenotes sit in the margin.[sidemark][/sidemark]
[sidenote]Like this one, numbered automatically.[/sidenote]

