[h2]Math & code[/h2]
Inline math $e^{i\pi} + 1 = 0$ and display math:
$$\sum_{k=1}^{n} k = \frac{n(n+1)}{2}$$
Inline code like [code mode=inline]collatz(27)[/code] sits in the text, and code blocks are highlighted:
[code lang=python]
def collatz(n):
    steps = 0
    while n != 1:
        n = n // 2 if n % 2 == 0 else 3 * n + 1
        steps += 1
    return steps
[/code]
[code]
bloops -pc -i showcase
[/code]

